    "long_instructions": "###What does the page remember?\r\nA page remembers what people do, and the display decides how to show it.\r\n\r\n**Do This**\r\n\r\n1. Tap a few snacks. Watch each tap land in Memory.\r\n2. Switch the Display between Count, Bar and Recent. Press Clear to start over.\r\n3. Tap See the code. Read the sample prompt, then write your own prompt to build this on your page.\r\n\r\n**Reflect & Discuss**\r\n\r\n- What does Memory keep every time you tap, and what changes when you switch the Display?\r\n- What would you want your own page to remember and show?\r\n",
